# BuildKit uses `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` in preference to the context-root .dockerignore
# when building `-f mayhem/Dockerfile`. Upstream's root .dockerignore whitelists only a subset of
# the tree (dropping mayhem/, tests/, .git); this override keeps the FULL repo — including .git
# (the grader / PATCH tier need the history) and tests/ (the oracle build needs
# tests/unittests/**, and the fuzz seed corpus is harvested from tests/fuzzing/) — and only prunes
# local build output from the context.
mayhem-build/
build/
build-fuzz/
build-tests/
